Run a test with (this will compile AND run):
sbatch run_ggca.sh

Manually compile code with:
source env_ursa_intelllvm.sh
make ca     # Original CA standalone
make ggca   # Gaussian grid CA standalone

Make options:
ca: original standalone cellular automata
ggca: gaussian grid standalone cellular automata
DEBUG=YES: use debug mode (defualt is NO)

Compiled code is placed in build/

Clean build/ directory with:
make clean
